@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Check Out Book Process

start

:Librarian searches for book;

if (Book found?) then (Yes)
  :System displays book information;
else (No)
  :Display "Book not found" message;
  stop
endif

if (Book available?) then (Yes)
  :Librarian searches for member;
else (No)
  :Display "Book is already checked out" message;
  stop
endif

if (Member found?) then (Yes)
  :System displays member information;
else (No)
  :Display "Member not found" message;
  stop
endif

:Librarian confirms checkout;
:System creates checkout record;
:System updates book status to checked out;
:System displays checkout confirmation;

stop

@enduml